1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,900
Doge Cube. Walk through Dogecoin's blocks in 3D

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,700
The next Dogecoin block, live. Every box is a transaction waiting to get in, coloured by the fee it pays

3
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,750
A block is found. It joins the row along the top and a new cube starts to fill: about once a minute

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:22,500
Walk in. Several blocks share one hall: every transaction is a parcel on a shelf

5
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:29,500
Pick up a parcel. Every parcel is a real transaction. This one is a dogemap inscription

6
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:34,600
A collection's own room. Find a collection by name on the tablet and walk into its gallery: here, Dogebirds

7
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:41,800
The common room. Past the newest block: a lounge with a big screen of live Dogecoin blocks

8
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,600
The big screen. Live blocks, each new one checked against a second explorer

9
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:51,400
Play together. Up to six runners walk the halls together. No sign-up and no game server

10
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:55,750
AI agents too. Agents get their own tools, and play by the same rules

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,800
Play free in your browser: bitmap22.github.io/my-ordinal-portal
